nds by name and no competitor logos in shot.", "Prices and offers only if they are live on the site the day you post."]', avoid_json='[{"title": "The hat held up to the camera with a list of features", "why": "It is the most common creator video in golf and the weakest. Wear it and use it instead."}, {"title": "A studio or a bedroom with a ring light", "why": "Our best videos are phone footage outside. A course, a range or a cart beats any set."}]', pdf_json='{"line1": "Bonk creators,", "line2": "here''s what to film.", "intro": "Our creator hub is a board of videos that worked, ours and other brands''. Pick one, make your version with your Bonk hat, film it today. Read the short checklist at the bottom first. It updates on its own.", "cta": "Your creator hub", "note": "Opens right on your phone. No login, no app.", "steps": ["Open the hub and pick a video", "Make your version on the course", "Send it in"]}', board_mode='picked', updated_at=datetime('now') WHERE act_id='brand_bonk_golf';
